# Build context for deploy/host/Dockerfile: the entrypoint and what build.sh
# staged. Build from this directory after build.sh (see README.md):
#
#   docker build -t h2host:local .
#
# stage/ holds a module compiled from the owner's own disc. It must never
# hold the disc itself or any other game data — build.sh stages only the
# Linux h2, the module with its stamp, and default.xbe — so the disc formats
# stay excluded here as a backstop.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!stage/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.iso
**/*.xiso
**/*.map
